    <string name="ntfy_instructions"><![CDATA[<b>How to set up:</b><br><br>
1. <b>Permissions:</b> if the <b>\"Enable Overlay\"</b> and <b>\"Disable Battery Optimization\"</b> buttons appear at the top, tap them and grant the permissions. They let links open by themselves and keep the listener always running.<br><br>
2. <b>Pairing:</b> tap <b>\"Generate Topic and Key\"</b>. The service starts by itself and the QR code appears.<br><br>
3. <b>On your phone:</b> open <b>SendTo ScreenMate</b>, go to <b>Sending Settings</b>, tap <b>\"Scan Receiver QR\"</b> and point the camera at the QR code.<br><br>
4. <b>Use:</b> in Google Maps pick a place or a route, tap <b>Share</b> and choose <b>SendTo ScreenMate</b>. It opens here automatically with the navigator chosen in <b>Auto-Open Settings</b>.<br><br>
To pair more phones later, tap <b>\"Show QR code for the Sender\"</b>.]]></string>
